### 更新相机 IP 列表
POST http://localhost:3000/api/parameters/nested
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "computerVisionBaselineMat",
  "path": "camIPList",
  "value": ["192.168.1.140", "192.168.1.141", "192.168.1.142"]
}

### 查看当前 baseline 配置
GET http://localhost:3000/api/parameters/computerVisionBaselineMat

### 查看所有参数
GET http://localhost:3000/api/parameters